<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse turnover falls to HUF 7.721 bln.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse turnover falls to HUF 7.721 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover fall to 7.721 billion forints on Thursday from 8.480 billion on Wednesday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsrogm +36 1 327-4040</p>
